{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/C.gif?t=1752549497\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/story_en.png?t=1752549497\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In West City, 2135, half a century after mysterious superpowers emerged, society has undergone dramatic changes. &quot;Superpowered criminals&quot; - undetectable, unpredictable, and untraceable - have become a massive threat to social stability and prosperity. <br>In this chaotic era, the peace-loving superpowered girl &quot;Luna&quot; decides to follow her sister's path and join the government as a security officer to protect people. <br>At this critical moment, the terrorist organization &quot;Liberators&quot; hidden in a corner of the city begins large-scale operations\u2014 The rookie female officer Luna will soon understand that the &quot;Liberators&quot; are far more than just heinous superpowered criminals. Facing conflicting beliefs, people's lamentations, and historical truths... how will this society of superpowers navigate such despair ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/\u57ce\u5e02\u666f_\u6050\u653b\u7248_\u5b8c\u7a3f.png?t=1752549497\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/\u63ed\u958b\u8d85\u80fd\u529b\u4e16\u754c\u7684\u9762\u7d17_en.png?t=1752549497\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using the &quot;Replication&quot; superpower, gradually uncover the truth of the superpowered society and embark o